{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1336804-virtues-question","id":1336804,"title":"Virtues question","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-09-19T02:26:31-07:00","id":1336804,"title":"Virtues question","content":"I think I must be missing something about virtues and their benefit.<br /> As I read it, they exist of a spectrum between your two virtues (with Honor and Prowess being them on the example on page 189 of Hero), and when you spend momentum you get bonus dice equal to the momentum track.<br /> As written (and with my knee jerk that rows of five dots fill in from the left) this feels like pushing to the virtue on the right is most advantageous.<br /> <br /> I'm assuming that the track starts with only the middle dot filled in, and that the hero gets one or zero bonus for only that dot, and only when it is moved one or two places to the left or right they get one, two (or three?) bonus dice, but I can see that mentioned specifically. <br /> <br /> How should I be handling bonus dice given by virtues? No bonus for the middle dot and inoy when it moves in either direction do they get the Virtuous condition and start receiving bonus dice, to a maximum of two per momentum spent?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3580-monkeybloke","name":"MonkeyBloke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"35"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-09-19T03:37:28-07:00","id":1336815,"title":"","content":"Check post 34, 35 and mainly 36 for doubts on Virtues.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/mai